      "handle": "hbc008j",
      "body_html": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">キャリバー6R54</h2>\n<div class=\"section section-space-top-3 section-space-bottom-3 color-black bg-white\" data-flexible-body-template-id=\"{9AD1284B-B050-4D92-92E9-976CDF38DBF0}\" data-flexible-body-template-name=\"One Column Contents\" data-flexible-body=\"content\" data-item-workflow-state=\"{0D66BF56-A9CF-4569-9AEB-F0164AA526E2}\" data-item-language=\"ja-JP\" data-item-version=\"1\" data-item-id=\"{A5A29BF8-F00B-48D5-ACCD-A004D2F8FDB9}\" data-item-name=\"s01\" id=\"s01\">\n<div class=\"section-body\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"fxbBasic\">\n<div class=\"row gx-2 gx-md-3 gy-5\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\" class=\"col-md-12\">\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">約72時間のロングパワーリザーブとGMT機能を備えたキャリバー6R54を搭載。長時間の使用でも安心のパフォーマンスを発揮します。</p>\n<p><img style=\"float: none;\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0684/0827/9342/files/SPB377J1_01_480x480.png?v=1779783609\"></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-flexible-body=\"wrapper\"><br></div>\n<div data-flexible-body=\"wrapper\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">高い判読性</h2>\n<div class=\"section section-space-top-3 section-space-bottom-3 color-black bg-white\" data-flexible-body-template-id=\"{9AD1284B-B050-4D92-92E9-976CDF38DBF0}\" data-flexible-body-template-name=\"One Column Contents\" data-flexible-body=\"content\" data-item-workflow-state=\"{0D66BF56-A9CF-4569-9AEB-F0164AA526E2}\" data-item-language=\"ja-JP\" data-item-version=\"1\" data-item-id=\"{4B17E69A-71C0-4C99-B8B7-F1F776797C90}\" data-item-name=\"s02\" id=\"s02\">\n<div class=\"section-body\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"fxbBasic\">\n<div class=\"row gx-2 gx-md-3 gy-5\">\n<div class=\"col-md-12\">\n<p>先端が赤い24時針とヘアライン仕上げのベゼル上に配された24時間表記が、GMTウオッチとしての高い判読性を実現。<br><br></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\" data-flexible-body=\"wrapper\"><img style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; float: none;\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0684/0827/9342/files/SPB377J1_02_480x480.png?v=1779783609\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"fxbBasic-image  is-type-4\">\n<div class=\"align-center\"><br></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
